ewProfile.png'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/11/theyll-be-back-patcon-oklahoma-city-and.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8567894479851994304' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8567894479851994304' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 16, 2014 at 6:38 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6526780066705481574</id><published>2014-11-16T18:36:46.763-07:00</published><updated>2014-11-16T18:36:46.763-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Every account I&amp;#39;ve read claims that Reno was i...</title><content type='html'>Every account I&amp;#39;ve read claims that Reno was in Washington when she presented the CS plan to Clinton, and then signed off on it. In the year or so following the holocaust at Mt. Carmel I was exposed to a lot of Whitewater-connected rumors involving Waco, but I&amp;#39;ve never seen any substantive evidence of a connection. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8567894479851994304/comments/default/6526780066705481574'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8567894479851994304/comments/default/6526780066705481574'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/11/theyll-be-back-patcon-oklahoma-city-and.html?showComment=1416188206763#c6526780066705481574' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='23' src='http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-CdehOMAdGmU/U8b9GaqH43I/AAAAAAAAKnc/9NFpgc6WOsk/s220/NewProfile.png'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/11/theyll-be-back-patcon-oklahoma-city-and.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8567894479851994304' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8567894479851994304' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 16, 2014 at 6:36 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2891032237234877308</id><published>2014-11-16T18:22:14.508-07:00</published><updated>2014-11-16T18:22:14.508-07:00</updated><title type='text'>2 questions and truthfully I don&amp;#39;t know the an...</title><content type='html'>2 questions and truthfully I don&amp;#39;t know the answers. Did Janet Reno as the AG order the attack on the Waco church from that federal building in OKC? And last, wasn&amp;#39;t that federal building in OKC a hub for the other federal building in that part of the country and held the government&amp;#39;s hard copy paperwork on the details of the government&amp;#39;s Whitewater land scam?&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8567894479851994304/comments/default/2891032237234877308'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8567894479851994304/comments/default/2891032237234877308'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/11/theyll-be-back-patcon-oklahoma-city-and.html?showComment=1416187334508#c2891032237234877308' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/11/theyll-be-back-patcon-oklahoma-city-and.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8567894479851994304' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8567894479851994304' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2060908358"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 16, 2014 at 6:22 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7435415799612575883</id><published>2014-11-15T10:55:29.026-07:00</published><updated>2014-11-15T10:55:29.026-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Billy THE KID KILLER Clinton had a several THOUSAN...</title><content type='html'>Billy THE KID KILLER Clinton had a several THOUSAND page government terror bill ready the DAY AFTER OKC. It was passed UNREAD and was just another assault on the Constitution. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I have to tell you that the SOG smells like PURE .gov.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;And the Mahon brothers talk about IDIOTS.&lt;br /&gt;I&amp;#39;ve noted that .gov and the $PLC and the ADL sure think rightwing 2nd Amendment folks are BAD and they want us GONE.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Will Grigg, the man is a fire-breathing patriot like the founding fathers, hell more like the Swamp Fox Francis Marion.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8567894479851994304/comments/default/7435415799612575883'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8567894479851994304/comments/default/7435415799612575883'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/11/theyll-be-back-patcon-oklahoma-city-and.html?showComment=1416074129026#c7435415799612575883' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/11/theyll-be-back-patcon-oklahoma-city-and.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8567894479851994304' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8567894479851994304' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-914247830"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 15, 2014 at 10:55 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1649527422321647091</id><published>2014-11-15T04:40:44.580-07:00</published><updated>2014-11-15T04:40:44.580-07:00</updated><title type='text'>http://sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2011/11...</title><content type='html'>http://sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2011/11/ssi-exclusive-hiding-mass-murder-behind.html?m=1&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;You might also enjoy this post written by one of the two citizen reporters who broke and kept alive the Fast and Furious story.  It is about how Newsweek spiked a story on PATCON at the last minute after pressure from DC.  Fascinating stuff.  </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8567894479851994304/comments/default/1649527422321647091'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8567894479851994304/comments/default/1649527422321647091'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/11/theyll-be-back-patcon-oklahoma-city-and.html?showComment=1416051644580#c1649527422321647091' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/11/theyll-be-back-patcon-oklahoma-city-and.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8567894479851994304' source='http://www.blogger.c